{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1271,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235a75f9e6704669ac370667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚……好沉重……\n好像在地上扎根了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "27253b520cf0adf2abdf36023e5eb43464458060ceee674a3fb5c2bbabd2533a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc81baad2823d5a9d0f1060f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是您说没问题的话，\n我会去照办的……但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c87ad7b61c3d31ab991a548b55a5e789fe46e735c0773aa2bce1959aa1362a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae82b02663263d2bf5f30915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太过乱来的话……\n说不定会失去什么重要的东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fad5a7856c8556a5c91df3b55ee82767cef99444faa4cb80c00651a758fbda4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c52540db918503fc914ca0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚轻盈得仿佛生出了双翼……！\n有种无论哪里都能一跃而至的\n感觉……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17edc30a16aaf030f3efe90c737d866634e8d482b462462749a867c2cae489d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f7be2db5a0e070ee0d2a68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跨过蓝玉般的海洋、\n穿过红玉般的大陆……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "575c21ee3f952fa53108dc6777fdc29dc75630f927dff02737d99f10504c5199",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb222b77d231ac76fefd965",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朋友……正在朝我招手……\n要是能握住她的手的话，一定——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d46b1ef588bbaba082248340a1649eefe61f6290d07143b33d38cdea6469cd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c7587f5c24525d261d23fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "埋下的种子，\n如今正是发芽之时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70034e2199cb5ba0d7fcc88ffb0d1425e002a747ac712d54c05a1a63d6c008d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44136c5efd28c702eb34a2b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要脚踏实地，\n不管以怎样的野兽为敌，我都不会输……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c3fa10ca994016496df5efd8ff3fbf562a7c7729386c5114bbf54c2763fae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ffe3bdbcd7ed5e3181c302",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朋友正朝我微笑……\n这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8f9a58e979d315a5573d43e794c58acafb921eac5ccf76664c7ff655d87e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2f4fc040bf2df5d8a86a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真正应该追逐的影子……\n我已经找到了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d5b5aa4ad42ebcb7ff924a64129b925d256e08ee5127c352e34fead6c0cf9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3b6b38040deda0d2de26e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的状况……\n感觉还不错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb87572f335b3aae2350742f27d71d4a3f29703cfb454c101b7907a420c4660c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17961eed33b4149e280cf73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人鱼能在海中畅游……\n我也能在赛道上驰骋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49a7cf242f1daddad9bc37da5a4d80bba06377e6330427d6ed6b7b1fffef0fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2551be720c634be364c8b72b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么……\n距离那个身影……愈发遥远了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3525fe2af24aee9fbe8e4f654bc9319b59c64ed3d1f4dd061a5859711f96779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ebb4dee1b0680a4466bb4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要能迈出第一步的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c17fa074cf96e2a29033b3f0cb68a4eca880940c36e59e6a8a96cc2732b687b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edc18d7350b5eb9388dba82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间不会倒流……\n我们能做到的，只有全力以赴……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8db15be86e6d406949313445c4124de5e18e55c053cf6a4c7f779511743ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84cb099f09340ef63f73379b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉就像被关在牢笼之中……\n又狭窄、又寒冷……",
      "source_fingerprint": "62c74a86461bf84b9cde06a1e9187cc07173c6e4433a8a2cee29e880e2ebbad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41838ceaa8ede662c06dac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经下过决心，一定要追上那个影子了……\n所以——",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d686a3a6528e6cf3d64c634012d4ca70bfb971912b9414a073401a0b0f7f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a846a907ff9d54c0977879ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果这是场噩梦，就快醒来吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda3c9b88151789d4f65924c163ac12282509f0e4366259770b8906580da7b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c9d444cda79d27f065295a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e9a37a7299ae6af83b260b95b249622a3d703b9920aaf7b306240f9a503b631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e1c3681eed4772928f9862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……上吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3807e94b900a2edc32ad57b489a75c99c1c4253bb1321727c3994e19576fa078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0de6ab5eaf230c8b9fc7dee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4200ffa8d100277aebb5547f92fe9e9fd310e48b0e74d4586f54d44f4ae3ff47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475ba125512a0698d4f9b8cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试试看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f292474d6dd6fa398b1d9395b27f49e3092b14a4f7aa3e9cc82fe7c66c643bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1a109413247806614a1cc86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d0eeceded72eace8823cc24b753a0a3007c8ea0e0a4fc8073e9cf559b5eb03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9847f0cf6d8451461e84a5dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8160a5d5173c64bf6663ecdf0abbdb4366485a3dfae0391cf8dc62dfd961ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a7cbbc8ea6a06ff04a20e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好遥远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "18ffeab6b20d40bb2a2b5b724533aaec5de1f0165eeccb28460bc157e64e65ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3794550f7644264e222df256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "湛蓝的世界……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea27e1c11b3f1a44b5978d9895bec5676d2d197cd9d60f04c2da4430b033898",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f60b6582c24d147a21d7e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能有这般成长，全都靠您……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ea7f49e97b519c8fcd7f0cdc7cd4dd66f488bfd1d282c7626158c795b7b2b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd40da865c75af26e4ab0b75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您……",
      "source_fingerprint": "636ef4918c31b98ec819ebb559ca0e111f971a9b9ba35369021d53d6997f37fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7720ed4a5b2742eae664d4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……拜托您了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "395029cc282b8bc6815a832e840dc0dbc1e0996060e66054e07e3f36685427f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ecb2ee1ec39ec97d8ca2093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配合起来的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b88c2a1ac706fc297b6eef01077f57b77ad3dd9b42367a8a4f400413383ccd80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c65f417d8b6e808e1a3d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标只有一个……",
      "source_fingerprint": "37db6500b95067611df086635f23712287eca99759a0001233ef6d7bdec7487f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770a63fd86cac09e47cc6f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您……",
      "source_fingerprint": "636ef4918c31b98ec819ebb559ca0e111f971a9b9ba35369021d53d6997f37fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c313be2bb68ecf3eb4edfb2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朋友正朝我微笑……\n这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8f9a58e979d315a5573d43e794c58acafb921eac5ccf76664c7ff655d87e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fe872f6a8b895203e209796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朋友……正在朝我招手……\n要是能握住她的手的话，一定——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d46b1ef588bbaba082248340a1649eefe61f6290d07143b33d38cdea6469cd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f8879cf374bf0a401ae55b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您……",
      "source_fingerprint": "636ef4918c31b98ec819ebb559ca0e111f971a9b9ba35369021d53d6997f37fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0790e93e0715107977c92b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…始めます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c229d304cb5676e332e8a595aff7707a9880a7694176cd32ef166c7c0c641bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5064ca77f45ef6461b0e19cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……抓住那道影子了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87b1a98c6b1450e3a4eb0869103e14e0e828c42f284c0dd1eab252521ab293a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee80078c6ede0de0233218fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要与它齐头并进，还很遥远啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db3dabb819279a4f9b093e33cbc26eccd7a79f94e173e0b54744d92896ee9771",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b8a4ad76852810d23b2553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要抓住它的话……得更强才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "24929fd58d25be9bf3cb3268b5074abb989576cbcd874a37da2947dbc6784431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de6f2d15039ed83214a0e820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……渐行渐远了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fa4072af599cc2114f7da320fa066762f6d8aae8c6a3bc78694acf9d19a283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1d46b524ae823437bb504b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比阴影更快……尽情驰骋……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17bee0d85e8ae6c64cee81ce0975633b574a33d2256c7f4eab2ada6d42ab0ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2a6454d5e7f61eb0422354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……稍微接近那个影子一些了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd54dd06b124dfd6d6b7322cf06bf5f84878db40c86070385e9af3617de159c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb84eaaaa40937e6ddc83c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利の1杯、\r\nできあがりです…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83decb1d4e64433c54eb9241eb81f90708e56f1fa484e0d6102934079fede7da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1815d7429eaef59ff1ca0608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あの影に…近づけているでしょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e29efa02fb73d0a1a555628b9fdc4ff95e165a52bbe78483da0d2cb5b4d052d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf76320f559df52a010d3a56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……上吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3807e94b900a2edc32ad57b489a75c99c1c4253bb1321727c3994e19576fa078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8643bda7b882e7fa2e82a1ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……一定要追上您！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f4ce500142c252fae08b50b00cd4a01cc88d2df4997fb7bb489e75bd28c8534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab633de4daa1c8cc7be44536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日は…あんこの甘みを引き立てる\r\nコロンビアの深煎りで。飲みやすく\r\nユキノさんのお口にも合うでしょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "007d51532ee0a35e752bc1302a94475dffa0d5dee5a9fa5b521a9afa6c24b5dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6c8b2053fdc1635f927aed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样啊……在喜欢的地方……\r\n赛马娘们发生了争执……好……\r\n我会试着……去调解看看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec5fc57508cdacecb5016ba2a98351a02dec1e4adb81436eee6d92dad884d78a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65013d0cadebd38ddb1de78b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和速子的共享空间……\r\n有很多与事件相关的话题可以谈……\r\n真的、有很多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6354d4741a98c45c9aba90b092f03a700a5c90070a6a6a77d0807577641ef5c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:949f81c37ce0e438cd10d150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七彩的群星、黄昏的黑猫、水彩的天空……\n然后、您则是……您是——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ed5b5105c4a7420c26d2e849b8a97c260374d7338ff6ff1fddf2bc4ddb95df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a3c31c1816103e847b20b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノさん手作りのどら焼きには…\r\nマンデリンですね。甘さと苦みが\r\n相まって…深い味わいが楽しめます",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d8d02962c7ef0d5eca650dce38831b36c3711272e4086ba72db5f89f92b2f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b2f48ab7bb9082ef457d34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "にゃん…にゃん…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c76a72c5f3379a1acfc163ca3a1c3ab0dff050c8c6c5d4672f44fd56c94b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b2aee879f9f9d5016a95fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞ、小さなお客様…\r\n幽遠の園で憩いのひとときを…にゃあ～…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e3d70241a0381fbf426fede988b476db04a9ebe08ec1c094c10141618bd759",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b63c30b835b6c313deac1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我也喜欢、独处……\r\n所以能明白你的心情……\r\n正因如此……才会好奇……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6ddc95f941f1aae2d251d3b9a7c007e6722d8ef3f1f3e04aea00c729ac3c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "400056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f802ca67a233f36a986f423a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノさんが淹れる緑茶に合う\r\nチョコ…ショコラオランジュを\r\n柚子にアレンジしてみましょうか…",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ee866e184b3b5ec94af7d1e7c1c5dd75c193967bad2e99958c2ca2f2f41d81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "400072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7fc61c86e40dde082337cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04353b27949712113f95ab86d04897462dbe0ce31a97b8de04ef417a8e5a13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72b6e69196dfa2311f7f01c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりました……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aae41ee8ac0b39b9dfd39af2afe78272eaf1c83da0388a9a0a0d943d4142244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a882024bc1f49e5828ce45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よかった……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3074925125bfaeea218a18d23b753b0c9862ef221dcd4c7c2160b997bea44a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af915c9801dac52de9aae167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よかった……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3074925125bfaeea218a18d23b753b0c9862ef221dcd4c7c2160b997bea44a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:019fca36436b0a6e91d7fb71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed773836fe2f6216ea8f6b794565df4d5b4d1c9d836ba5cd85e3729fb31e0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36fec70d98e2fab601f132fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed773836fe2f6216ea8f6b794565df4d5b4d1c9d836ba5cd85e3729fb31e0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a5f4eb662ec4cf85fd41108",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はは……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5d61662554b61134ae7b25e8270d304456e0980b6298ea31b287073c2a1af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
