        "1025",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d6b522e12199e35037ab54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はは……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5d61662554b61134ae7b25e8270d304456e0980b6298ea31b287073c2a1af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62744feeaa04707a758cdcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はは……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5d61662554b61134ae7b25e8270d304456e0980b6298ea31b287073c2a1af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9db8a7729d959be6df8b95a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站在舞台上的时候……\n感觉就好像能看见别的世界……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c08fcc60d7a308db2ce62e48dcbc2b545f592bbc1734f738d0cec0a340443f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eb1a9e8a8eb76b9bd0659ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后会发生什么……\n请您亲自见证吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06efe4562351d6caf54c6138e1f135c93d93ca2137cd667e1c57790b5895b1f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0884ede6a3c51ce22a4eb4f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……能追上那个背影吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc5517a2948109781797cba9843e9e84adcce1e95479ac9b2233a529899159b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e2deacc4caf155c51baee3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您……\n是将我的『普通』视作常事，\n正常地接受的人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e7882289694d161ae731c5b8d28a2a52976492b8239f071c7d5fde71bc7789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486aef790254d0047c2a8c50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪白色的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78d3bf833594b1a32a92cc497fbc19d099200f5de67f1d9f658d64828b97b07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687b4d8c95455312f8cb5d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了在舞台上绽放光辉，\n蕴含着不可思议的力量的衣服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45f22210fb43e2ccd2a107ab0d7c974a36ff716514d24cfbae180760fff303e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:952aff402c9a50ffcb77af7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……果然，我很中意这个颜色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd36cfb8eb324306d5d0855cc1826748dd2f52ade1ac1de7de6668328f1fdc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ace4195e2d02e9a6281cb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着很舒服……\n又整洁、又清爽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93e6848d319ceb8b81642e34bffef64859a267c5ff16ecbbc28e3e0611a8e67b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4462cca25190ebd925cf0742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我起舞的时候，影子也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b3a3dc7a59fa49a1f6940b4a1c22085b19863972d9b30292554532e0292870",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b5236a82520d4905f62e9ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚、黑暗、那个影子……\n我喜欢的东西，都是这个颜色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8a53034d296df83703df088c0a1d70809cc432c612fd0118513139a9090c647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5070a23ee667515d28a84492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞ、大切な人とのひとときを…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88500450b6dd9522216dfc707e7dd0aed26f6132b96742eb762954d36babd6c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18f698bcd9305f8cb6f8b5e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコの名札は、\r\n食べてはいけませんよ…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebad595c7a9043afb8261b25a0cf32143aa9a3cc156e655ef48d7f6691a67f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fff3e419bd06e90d8a27d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听见了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a09fa7eae8d5a393feba5133c0b81343a65fed2dec4b44c5b1c15b97048267d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a737102553bb3c9f7c6038f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定……要追上那个影子……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a856b902e9ed8ff93fd49f7aa752e174a9c1ef178bc1eca192990d801691b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18b7a292f3e35be56e87a34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頭はすっきり、服はゆったり…幸せの条件です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dcefae666c159380f656dc14d72bd7492ef2ecbc993f1ad49d1a5ee87b215a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa6ec443f56e5677f458d60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この靴、歩きやすいんです。星のない夜も。",
      "source_fingerprint": "457d7059d9ec6c614067bb3f145c4b6ee6a185fe200cf287f4b56ed2e333d7b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
